{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788113666180704026,"compiled_state":{"alias":"western-terrazzo-perch","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"fd60c11cd1144a179e184cfd6d25cc1ab4d8029241d7870587c444b436b7b74b","event_uuid":"be1f7bba-f383-4e27-bb3d-502e892cba00","position":{"commit_sha":"5f1a4bc6357f7468ef8bc9c7498e350a6accc76e","position":"1788109201597861001-be1f7bba-f383-4e27-bb3d-502e892cba00"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"63ad38745dcb93ff5d589fef531cc59c278a2a1319726aa963bf6482c6f9eceb","event_uuid":"3acefd41-c493-4d78-b94b-4e844f20dc0a","position":{"commit_sha":"934ca38c8cc10a6811cd0598dba5d3bc5d7c675d","position":"1788109250642819001-3acefd41-c493-4d78-b94b-4e844f20dc0a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"48423d652f660b79840c179e34e420410d61d21db41ddace092cc368db980e81","event_uuid":"01c0f209-3397-4734-a727-30b776a90807","position":{"commit_sha":"6043eaf8596d3fbbae30c88594ddc07f3798878d","position":"1788109295852217001-01c0f209-3397-4734-a727-30b776a90807"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788109201597861001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"01c0f209-3397-4734-a727-30b776a90807","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e9d5-c850-d505-4a5a"}],"description":"Discovered while implementing e9d5-c850-d505-4a5a (typed reconciler mutation\npayload contracts, ADR 0107). Two producers construct (outbound, update)\nMutation payloads with different shapes:\n\n- differ.py's older _compute_mutations_emit_both path emits a flat,\n  unwrapped \"changed\" dict directly as Mutation.payload.\n- outbound_pass.py / binding_walk.py wrap the same information as\n  {\"changed_fields\": {...}, \"comments\": [...], \"labels\": [...], \"links\": [...]}.\n\nADR 0107's typed OutboundUpdatePayload contract standardizes on the wrapped\nshape (changed_fields); the flat legacy shape from differ.py's older path\nwould fail typed validation today. This is a pre-existing inconsistency,\nNOT introduced by e9d5 -- e9d5 only documents it (see the corpus README and\ne9d5's ticket comment recording approved intentional deltas) and does not\nreconcile it, since producer rewiring is ADR 0107's deferred \"Cut\" step and\nout of e9d5's own scope (AC7).\n\nSuggested follow-up: decide (a) which shape is canonical going forward, and\n(b) migrate differ.py's _compute_mutations_emit_both to emit the wrapped\nchanged_fields shape so both producers agree before any producer is\nrewired to construct OutboundUpdatePayload directly (that \"Cut\" step is a\nseparate, later ticket).\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- A decision is recorded on which shape is canonical for (outbound, update)\n  Mutation payloads.\n- differ.py's _compute_mutations_emit_both and outbound_pass.py /\n  binding_walk.py agree on payload shape, verified by a test asserting both\n  producers emit the same normalized shape for an equivalent update.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"162e-57c3-f7d4-4457","ticket_type":"task","title":"Reconcile dual outbound-update payload shapes (differ.py flat vs outbound_pass.py wrapped)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["be1f7bba-f383-4e27-bb3d-502e892cba00","3acefd41-c493-4d78-b94b-4e844f20dc0a","01c0f209-3397-4734-a727-30b776a90807"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788113666180704026,"uuid":"227ddeff-5be5-436f-bdf9-5fc923d95e4f"}